From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ned <github@edoardo.fyi>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 17:55:39 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 19/20] Metal: prewarm recorded selectors for current
 anisotropy

GSRendererHW emits software anisotropy zero or the configured maximum. Project only startup keys onto those values and deduplicate; actual draw selectors and recording stay untouched. Keep a legacy warm-set switch and report source/projected counts.

diff --git a/pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Metal/GSDeviceMTL.mm b/pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Metal/GSDeviceMTL.mm
index a5c9443954b543a8403bb752dffe05e658ee592a..b1750a50317f6551ab21049ae79608f6d2026cdf 100644
--- a/pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Metal/GSDeviceMTL.mm
+++ b/pcsx2/GS/Renderers/Metal/GSDeviceMTL.mm
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
